%% METAGRAPH REVISION: REPLAY AND CERTIFICATE SCOPE
%% The preceding receipt section is retained historical evidence. New source-only
%% receipts below concern the recovered CN/MG/TP elementary theorems. Exact symbolic
%% checks are separate from native Hets theorem discharge. Free-word, route,
%% natural-number and finite-list arguments use the written structural inductions.
%% The marked-zero view uses free-record generation and the exact original-matrix
%% section. No unproved marked-pair eta goal is promoted to a premise of a replay.
%% The general additive-defect proof is written next to its goals; the six native
%% attempts reached the 3-second bound. The tropical unequal-minimum proof and
%% finite-list leading-term induction are provided above. Their ATP status remains
%% distinct from those complete mathematical derivations and symbolic identities.
