%% REPLAY: use the existing block-extraction one-liner in this file to save
%% H24_POLY_EXTRACT_PY as extract.py. The normalizer uses Python standard library
%% only. PN25_ALGEBRA_REPLAY_PY requires SymPy. H24_POLY_REPLAY_PY uses the same
%% embedded source-only native driver with the new ten-goal plan. E search
%% limits are verifier resource limits; none is a constructor deadline.
%% Every polynomial clock above concerns the explicitly named algorithm and
%% its original input, with declared local cost and precision interfaces.
